            <div xml:id="d30">

                <pb facs="0122" n="20" sameAs="frus:frus1927v03/pg20"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.797/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-02-02T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">February 2,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3. Department understands from your telegrams No. 2, January 25, 3 p.m., and
                    January 29, 4 p.m., your despatch No. 45, January 12 and Consulate’s report of
                    January 13<anchor n="5" xml:id="d30-f1"/> that proposed contract is for <pb
                        facs="0123" n="21" xml:id="pg21"/> an exclusive franchise for tram-lines and
                    bus-lines on certain specified routes. To this as well as to customs exemptions
                    granted by contract the Department would not object. Should the contract,
                    however, go further than this and in effect restrict freedom of competition to
                    such a degree as to result in the virtual exclusion of American automotive
                    products from a particular market, you should predicate upon such exclusion
                    appropriate representations to the Greek Government pointing out that in
                    granting the concession the Greek Government is in fact consenting to
                    discrimination against American commerce. You may, in your discretion, state
                    orally that such discrimination would be viewed with concern by your
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
